# LCExtForwardHost opt-in list.
# Put this file next to LCExtForwardHost.dylib in LiveContainer's GLOBAL tweak folder.
# One app per line: either the .app name or its CFBundleIdentifier. "*" = all apps.
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Empty file / no file = nothing is converted.
# After changing this list, re-sign the app in LiveContainer once.

com.willfaust.madeora.app
com.minh-ton.Reynard
# Tip: the .app name works too (e.g. "Reynard"), and "*" = all apps.
